ADDENDA <Act No. 17463, Jun. 9, 2020>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force on the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Article 7 and 135 shall enter into force six months after the date of its promulgation, and the amended provisions of Article 135(5)14 of the Aviation Safety Act (Act No. 16643) shall enter into force on November 27, 2022.
Article 2 (Applicability to aircraft registration)
The amended provisions of Article 7 shall begin to apply where a domestic air operator or international air operator who obtains an air operator certificate (AOC) files an application for registration of aircraft on or after the date this Act enters into force.
Article 3 (Applicability to reporting on modification of regulations for aircraft operation by air operators)
The amended provisions of Article 93(5) and (6), 122(2) and (3), and 123(2), (3), and (5) shall begin to apply to reports, reports on modification, or reports of cancellation filed on or after the date this Act enters into force.

